  "description": "Kukura is a rooster-shaped spring rider from our Organic Play collection, painted in black, yellow and green. It takes the plain spring rider and gives it a bird with character, which young children respond to straight away. A child sits on the rooster, holds on and rocks it back and forth, which is all the imagination play a three-year-old needs. It is meant for ages 3 to 8. Spring riders take very little ground, so Kukura can fill a gap beside a bench or near a toddler slide. The roto-moulded body has a 3-year warranty and the spring a 1-year warranty. Tell us how many riders you need and we will place them on your drawing.",
